NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000369 "=head1 HOMEPAGE"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000370 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000371 "Please visit the project's homepage at L<https://metacpan.org/release/Text-ANSI-Util>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000372 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000373 "=head1 SOURCE"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000374 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000375 "Source repository is at L<https://github.com/perlancar/perl-Text-ANSI-Util>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000376 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000377 "=head1 SEE ALSO"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000378 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000379 "L<String::Pad> provides padding function for strings that do not contain ASCII"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000380 "escape codes nor wide characters."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000381 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000382 "L<Text::NonWideChar::Util> provides some other functions for strings that do not"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000383 "contain ASCII escape codes nor wide characters."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000384 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000385 "L<Text::WideChar::Util> provides utilities for strings that do not contain ANSI"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000386 "escape codes I<but> contain wide characters."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000387 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000388 "L<Text::ANSI::WideUtil> provides utilities for strings that contain ANSI escape"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000389 "codes I<and> wide characters."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000390 ""
