NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000401 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000402 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000403 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000404 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000405 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000406 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000407 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000408 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000409 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000410 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000411 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000412 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000413 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000414 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000415 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000416 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000417 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
